    "reviews": "\u201cLil' Arena is an indie game, from Greek developers, who decided to give the world a multiplayer without the usual chores associated with the genre. [Translated]\u201d<br>IGN Greece<br><br>\u201cThe character abilities are plenty, the story interesting and so 2-8 players can fill their time with a fulfuling battle, regardless of how busy their day-to-day life is. [Translated]\u201d<br>Games Life<br>",
